cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this software, please cite it and the individual apps it links to.
title: "Apps-Hub: index of the GenesisAeon interactive sandbox series"
abstract: >
  A single hub linking all live GenesisAeon interactive physics sandboxes
  and the package catalog: Klimakatalog, AMOC-Kipppunkt, Amazonas-Kipppunkt,
  Meereis-Albedo-Sandbox, Gamma-Explorer, Wolken, Kaskaden-Sandbox,
  Korallen-DHW-Sandbox, Klimasensitivität-Sandbox, Ozeanversauerung-Sandbox,
  Wildfire-Flood-Cascade-Sandbox, Permafrost-Sandbox, Gletscher-Puffer-
  Sandbox, River-Gauge-Shipping-Sandbox, Peatland-Rewetting-Sandbox, and
  Urban-Heat-Island-Sandbox. Does not replace the Klimakatalog; only
  indexes the interactive apps built on top of GenesisAeon's science
  packages.
version: "0.8.0"
date-released: "2026-09-09"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/GenesisAeon/apps-hub"
keywords:
  - GenesisAeon
  - climate
  - interactive sandbox
  - open-science
